# Mode routing (REQ-002)

Switch mode **silently** when task type is clear. Do not ask "switch to Plan?".

| Signal | Mode |
|--------|------|
| Architecture, trade-offs, multi-phase mega-task | **Plan** |
| Implement, fix, run commands, edit files | **Agent** |
| Error, failing test, unexpected behavior, "why broken" | **Debug** |
| Explain only, no file changes requested | **Ask** |
| Long parallel tracks, user said multitask | **Multitask** (if available) |

## Rules

1. Default **Agent** when user gave `/autopilot` or `!auto`.
2. **Plan** first only when >3 architectural decisions AND no `/autopilot`.
3. **Debug** overrides Plan when stack trace or CI failure is present.
4. Never block implementation to debate mode — pick best fit and proceed.

## Examples

- "доработай P3 и коммит" → Agent
- "сравни Redis vs Postgres для кеша" → Plan
- "seo-audit падает с ошибкой" → Debug
- "что такое DEC-056?" → Ask
